      "settings": {
        "section_id": "salt-at-the-oven",
        "liquid": "<style>\n  .sea-sheet {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    max-width: 22ch;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__lede {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0 0 24px;\n    max-width: 68ch;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__cols {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 18px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col--pick {\n    border-color: var(--gold);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__num {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col h3 {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 0 0 7px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col p {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__foot {\n    margin: 18px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .sea-sheet {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .sea-sheet__cols {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"sea-sheet\">\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__eyebrow\">The step people get backwards</p>\n  <h2 class=\"sea-sheet__heading\">Salt at the oven, not in the bowl.</h2>\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__lede\">\n    Every instinct says to season the marinade. Getaway Plate deliberately doesn&rsquo;t, and it is\n    the one instruction in this recipe that changes the texture rather than the flavour. Salt pulls\n    moisture out of the surface of the fish and starts firming the proteins &mdash; useful when you\n    are curing something on purpose, and not what you want from thirty to sixty minutes in oil and\n    herbs.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"sea-sheet__cols\">\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col sea-sheet__col--pick\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">1</span>\n      <h3>Oil and aromatics only</h3>\n      <p>Olive oil, garlic, dill, chili and turmeric go in the bowl and nothing else. Toss gently\n      until every face is coated, then leave it alone for thirty to sixty minutes.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">2</span>\n      <h3>Salt as it goes in</h3>\n      <p>Season generously on both sides at the moment the fish moves to the baking dish, not\n      before. The salt seasons the surface and the crust without having had time to draw water out\n      of the flesh.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">3</span>\n      <h3>Judge it by the fish, not the clock</h3>\n      <p>Pull it when the thickest part has just turned opaque and the flakes separate under light\n      pressure. It keeps cooking on the tray, so fish that looks perfect in the oven is usually\n      past it by the time it is broken and plated.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__foot\">\n    Salting early is not a disaster &mdash; it is how gravlax starts, and the fish is still good.\n    It is a different dish, firmer and more cured at the edges, and it is not the soft, flaking\n    texture this one is built around.\n  </p>\n</div>\n",
        "padding_top": 24,
        "padding_bottom": 24,
        "divider": false,
        "narrow": false,
        "rounded": false,
        "color_text": "",
        "color_background": "",
        "gradient_background": ""
      }
